# Session Preparation {{.SessionNum}}

**Campaign:** {{.CampaignID}}  
**Preparation Date:** {{.PrepDate.Format "2006-01-02"}}

---

## Previously On

<div class="session-prep-card">
{{.PreviouslyOn}}
</div>

---

## Active Quests

{{if .ActiveQuests}}
{{range .ActiveQuests}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<div class="prep-item">{{.}}</div>
</div>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>No active quests are recorded.</p>
{{end}}

---

## Relevant NPCs

{{if .RelevantNPCs}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>NPCs for this Session</h3>
{{range .RelevantNPCs}}
<div class="prep-item">• {{.}}</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{else}}
<p>No relevant NPCs were identified for this session.</p>
{{end}}

---

## Likely Scenarios

{{if .LikelyScenarios}}
{{range .LikelyScenarios}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<div class="prep-item">{{.}}</div>
</div>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>No likely scenarios identified.</p>
{{end}}

---

## Encounter Recommendations

{{if .EncounterRecommendations}}
{{range .EncounterRecommendations}}
<div class="encounter-recommendation">
<span class="cr-badge">CR {{.CR}}</span>
<span class="encounter-type">{{.Type}}</span>
<strong>{{.Name}}</strong>
<p>{{.Description}}</p>
{{if .Context}}
<p><em>{{.Context}}</em></p>
{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>No encounter recommendations generated.</p>
{{end}}

---

## Loot Suggestions

{{if .LootSuggestions}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>Suggested Rewards</h3>
{{range .LootSuggestions}}
<div class="prep-item">
<strong>{{.Name}}</strong> ({{.Rarity}}, {{.Type}})<br>
{{.Description}}
{{if .Context}}<br><em>{{.Context}}</em>{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{else}}
<p>No loot suggestions generated.</p>
{{end}}

---

## NPC Appearances

{{if .NPCAppearances}}
{{range .NPCAppearances}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>{{.Name}} <small>({{.Importance}})</small></h3>
<div class="prep-item"><strong>Role:</strong> {{.Role}}</div>
<div class="prep-item"><strong>Context:</strong> {{.Context}}</div>
</div>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>No NPC appearances planned.</p>
{{end}}

---

## Reminders

{{if .Reminders}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>Important Reminders</h3>
{{range .Reminders}}
<div class="prep-item">⚠️ {{.}}</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{else}}
<p>No pending reminders.</p>
{{end}}

